      "id": "arcane-plunder",
      "title": "Arcane Plunder",
      "subtitle": "Incremental Dungeon Game",
      "tagline": "Clear the fog. Loot with your mind.",
      "summary": "A bite-sized idle clicker adventure. Dispel magical fog tile by tile, reveal forgotten dungeons and pull treasure out of the shadows with telekinesis.",
      "description": [
        "Uncover the secrets of forgotten dungeons in a short, satisfying idle adventure. Click to dispel the magical fog, reveal hidden chambers and telekinetically loot ancient treasures.",
        "Spend your loot on range, telekinesis power and mana to reach deeper into the dungeon, then reset for permanent bonuses and go again. It's built to be finished: a few relaxed evenings, no endless grind.",
        "Find legendary artifacts, and make your own skill trees to share with friends through the Steam Workshop."
      ],
      "features": [
        "An idle game with a real ending",
        "Fog-covered dungeons to uncover",
        "Telekinetic looting and upgrades",
        "Prestige resets with permanent bonuses",
        "Steam Workshop skill trees"
      ],
      "genres": [
        "Idle",
