      "id": "crownbound",
      "title": "Crownbound",
      "subtitle": "Fantasy Kingdom Sim",
      "tagline": "Rule with gold, not with force.",
      "summary": "A fantasy kingdom sim where your heroes have minds of their own. Recruit them, set bounties, grow your realm and hope they fight monsters instead of chasing squirrels.",
      "description": [
        "You rule a growing fantasy kingdom, but you can't command your heroes directly. Warriors, mages, rogues and clerics roam freely with their own goals, fears and ambitions. You steer them with spells, rewards and smart kingdom management.",
        "Set bounties to send heroes after monsters and into dungeons. Build guilds, mage towers and forges, research upgrades and attract the right mix of adventurers.",
        "Heroes level up, learn new skills, buy gear at the market and loot it from fallen foes. They can also die, or wander off right when you need them."
      ],
      "features": [
        "Indirect control: lead with bounties and rewards",
        "Heroes with their own goals and fears",
        "Build and upgrade your kingdom",
        "Heroes level up and find legendary loot"
      ],
