    {
      "id": "powerlust",
      "title": "Powerlust",
      "subtitle": "Old School Action RPG",
      "tagline": "Old school action RPG. Every hit and dodge is yours.",
      "summary": "A dark, old school action RPG roguelike with manual combat, an open world and no rigid classes. Free and offline on mobile, with optional permadeath for hardcore fans.",
      "description": [
        "Travel through an open world, fight through procedurally generated dungeons and feed your lust for power. There's no auto combat: stats matter, but so does dodging attacks and aiming your own.",
        "Nothing is locked. Mix spells, weapons, abilities and masteries into your own class, like a fire mage with a two handed sword or a necromancer archer. Collect legendary and set items, craft gear and try the next build.",
        "Play it your way with isometric, top down, third person and first person cameras. On iOS and Android it's free, fully offline, with no forced ads and no pay to win."
      ],
      "features": [
        "Skill-based combat, no auto battle",
        "Build your own class from any mix of skills",
        "Open world and procedural dungeons",
        "Four camera modes",
        "Optional permadeath",
        "Free and offline on mobile, no pay to win"
      ],
